{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To maximize the area of the circular sector with a fixed perimeter, we start by expressing the perimeter and the area in terms of the radius \\( r \\) and the central angle \\( \\theta \\).\n\nThe perimeter of the sector is the sum of the two radii and the arc length:\n\\[\n2r + r\\theta = P\n\\]\nwhere \\( P \\) is the fixed perimeter. We can solve this equation for \\( \\theta \\):\n\\[\nr\\theta = P - 2r \\implies \\theta = \\frac{P - 2r}{r}\n\\]\n\nThe area \\( A \\) of the sector is given by:\n\\[\nA = \\frac{1}{2} r^2 \\theta\n\\]\nSubstituting the expression for \\( \\theta \\) from the perimeter equation into the area formula, we get:\n\\[\nA = \\frac{1}{2} r^2 \\left( \\frac{P - 2r}{r} \\right) = \\frac{1}{2} r (P - 2r) = \\frac{1}{2} Pr - r^2\n\\]\n\n","prefix_end":715,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":false,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,34508,279,3082,315,279,26931,10486,448,264,8356,46342,11,582,1191,553,36710,279,46342,323,279,3082,304,3793,315,279,10578,17767,435,1124,8,323,279,8622,9210,17767,1124,15976,1124,3593,785,46342,315,279,10486,374,279,2629,315,279,1378,11900,72,323,279,15580,3084,510,59,9640,17,81,488,435,59,15976,284,393,198,59,921,2870,17767,393,1124,8,374,279,8356,46342,13,1205,646,11625,419,23606,369,17767,1124,15976,1124,982,59,9640,81,59,15976,284,393,481,220,17,81,1124,6383,550,1124,15976,284,1124,37018,90,47,481,220,17,81,15170,81,532,59,2533,785,3082,17767,362,1124,8,315,279,10486,374,2661,553,510,59,9640,32,284,1124,37018,90,16,15170,17,92,435,61,17,1124,15976,198,59,921,3136,3696,10607,279,7493,369,17767,1124,15976,1124,8,504,279,46342,23606,1119,279,3082,14806,11,582,633,510,59,9640,32,284,1124,37018,90,16,15170,17,92,435,61,17,1124,2359,7,1124,37018,90,47,481,220,17,81,15170,81,92,1124,1291,8,284,1124,37018,90,16,15170,17,92,435,320,47,481,220,17,81,8,284,1124,37018,90,16,15170,17,92,2340,481,435,61,17,1